title: MikroTik REST API: NTP Client
agents: mikrotik_rest_api
catalog: hw/network/mikrotik
license: GPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 NTP client of a MikroTik router ({/system/ntp/client}).

 Reported: synchronisation status (WARN if not {synchronized}), the
 server synchronized with, the absolute time offset (default 200 ms /
 500 ms) and the stratum (default 10/15). Mode, servers, VRF and
 frequency drift are shown in the details. The offset is read with its
 unit (ns, us, ms, s); the REST API delivers a plain number in
 milliseconds.
 Levels via the rule {MikroTik REST API: NTP client}.

 Special agent {MikroTik RouterOS (mikrotik-rest-api)} in Setup >
 Agents > Other integrations, module "NTP client".

 Added in mikrotik-rest-api 1.1.0 by Klaus Paulitsch.

perfdata:
 Time offset.

inventory:
 One service if the NTP client is enabled.
